From 49d02f6c013c96275f4ada004760e7d1bb34e4ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: electrikjesus <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:28:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: Keep freeform Glass leash alpha after transition
 finish.

Re-apply RetroUi window_alpha/blur into finishT and after transitions, skip black task fill when glass is on, and denylist media/camera packages from force translucency.
